sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Utente A (editor)
    participant B as Utente B (sta guardando la task)
    participant WSGW as ws-gateway (pod X)
    participant API as api-service
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Redis (Pub/Sub)
    participant Q as Redis (Streams)

    B->>WSGW: WSS connect (JWT)
    B->>WSGW: subscribe(task:123)
    WSGW->>WSGW: verifica permesso (cache o query)
    WSGW->>R: SUBSCRIBE evt:task:123

    A->>API: PATCH /tasks/123 {status: done}
    API->>PG: UPDATE tasks SET status = ...
    PG-->>API: OK
    API->>R: PUBLISH evt:task:123 {task.updated, payload}
    API->>Q: XADD stream:jobs {audit, task, updated}
    API-->>A: 200 OK

    R-->>WSGW: messaggio su evt:task:123
    WSGW-->>B: push {task 123 updated}

    Q-->>Q: worker N consuma via XREADGROUP
    Q-->>Q: worker scrive audit_logs + XACK
